const props={"page": {"url": "/supporters/", "title": "Featured sponsors", "description": "Meet our marine sponsors through practical diesel-yacht ownership, engine-space planning, onboard storage and life at anchor. Explore each dedicated feature.", "schema": ["WebPage"], "pageType": "utility", "status": "ready", "indexable": true, "blockers": [], "headings": [], "faqs": [], "parent": "/supporters/", "parentTitle": "Featured sponsors"}};
const content="<section class=\"sn-page\"><p class=\"sn-kicker\">Our network sponsors</p><h1>Featured sponsors</h1><p class=\"sn-intro\">Explore our sponsors through life aboard an engine-maintained yacht. Each company has its own feature written for Marine Diesel Engine.</p><div class=\"sn-grid\"><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/boateye360/logo.webp\" alt=\"BoatEye360 logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">BoatEye360</a></h2><p>BoatEye360 supplies full-colour marine night-vision cameras for spotting vessels, markers and floating objects when light is limited.</p><a href=\"/supporters/boateye360/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/captain-matt/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"Captain Matt logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Captain Matt</a></h2><p>Captain Matt takes enquiries for engineering, captaincy, deliveries and vessel operations, alongside private Sydney Harbour charters through Exclusive Boats.</p><a href=\"/supporters/captain-matt/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/easy-inflatables/logo.webp\" alt=\"Easy Inflatables logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Easy Inflatables</a></h2><p>Explore Aerowave dinghies and yacht tenders from Easy Inflatables, with Australian design, welded seams and options for practical boating.</p><a href=\"/supporters/easy-inflatables/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/ferosticker/logo.webp\" alt=\"FeroSticker logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">FeroSticker</a></h2><p>FeroSticker offers automatic fire suppression for suitable enclosed boat compartments, activated by heat without batteries or onboard power.</p><a href=\"/supporters/ferosticker/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/brand/partners/flying-fish.webp\" alt=\"Flying Fish Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Flying Fish Sailing</a></h2><p>Flying Fish Sailing offers diesel-engine, maintenance and electrical-system courses alongside sailing tuition in Sydney.</p><a href=\"/supporters/flying-fish-sailing/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/honu/logo.webp\" alt=\"Honu Paddleboards logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Honu</a></h2><p>Discover Honu inflatable paddleboards, with Australian design, low weight and attention to stiffness for paddling during your boating holidays.</p><a href=\"/supporters/honu/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/mainstay-sailing/logo.svg\" alt=\"Mainstay Sailing logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Mainstay Sailing</a></h2><p>Learn to sail in the Whitsundays with Mainstay Sailing, offering practical RYA courses and private tuition from Coral Sea Marina in Airlie Beach.</p><a href=\"/supporters/mainstay-sailing/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/shakesure/logo.webp\" alt=\"ShakeSure logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">ShakeSure</a></h2><p>Explore ShakeSure anchor chain for strength, corrosion resistance and correct windlass fit, with galvanised, stainless-steel and duplex choices.</p><a href=\"/supporters/shakesure/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/sos-marine/feed-logo.webp\" alt=\"SOS Marine logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">SOS Marine</a></h2><p>SOS Marine makes lifejackets, rafts, man-overboard markers and recovery equipment to help protect people and bring them back aboard boats.</p><a href=\"/supporters/sos-marine/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/survival-official-logo.png\" alt=\"SURVIVAL First Aid Kits logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">SURVIVAL</a></h2><p>Equip your boat with SURVIVAL marine first-aid kits, organised supplies, water-resistant storage options and replacements for used contents.</p><a href=\"/supporters/survival-kit/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/water-makers-australia/logo.webp\" alt=\"Water Makers Australia logo\" width=\"210\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Water Makers Australia</a></h2><p>Make fresh water offshore with Water Makers Australia, offering marine reverse-osmosis systems with different capacities and modular components.</p><a href=\"/supporters/water-makers-australia/\">Read our feature \u2192</a></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/acebeam/logo.png\" alt=\"Acebeam logo\" width=\"293\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/acebeam/\">Acebeam</a></h2><p>Ordering a spare part often starts with a photograph of a plate you can barely see. The overhead light catches the edge of the engine, your phone throws a shadow over the number, and the parts desk still needs the last digit. Acebeam makes compact handheld torches and headlamps. A separate light lets you choose the angle of illumination independently of the camera.</p></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/bushman/logo.png\" alt=\"Bushman logo\" width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/bushman/\">Bushman</a></h2><p>A serviced diesel gets the yacht out of the marina. A cold galley makes staying away for the weekend considerably nicer. For owners whose boat still has a basic icebox, Bushman&#x27;s portable compressor chest is a way to carry milk, fresh ingredients and a prepared dinner aboard without making the next project a full galley rebuild.</p></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/seaair/logo.png\" alt=\"SeaAir logo\" width=\"4791\" height=\"1529\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/seaair/\">SeaAir</a></h2><p>On many cruising boats the engine box sits close to a sleeping space. Shut down after a long afternoon under power and the cockpit may cool well before that berth does. SeaAir supplies marine air conditioning and heating for suitable DC systems. The decision we&#x27;re interested in is what happens after the diesel stops and the house bank takes over.</p></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/boat-names-australia/logo.png\" alt=\"Boat Names Australia logo\" width=\"943\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/boat-names-australia/\">Boat Names Australia</a></h2><p>When a boat is ashore for engine work, the hull is suddenly accessible in a way it rarely is at the mooring. Stand behind the stern and it&#x27;s easy to see why a tired name has been on the owner&#x27;s list for years. Boat Names Australia makes custom boat lettering and marine graphics. You can plan the new finish while the mechanical work is under way.</p></article><article class=\"sn-card\"><img class=\"sn-logo\" src=\"/images/supporters/poclink/logo.png\" alt=\"Poclink logo\" width=\"344\" height=\"266\" loading=\"lazy\"><h2><a href=\"/supporters/poclink/\">Poclink</a></h2><p>A mechanic has the old component on the bench. The parts runner is at the marina entrance and the service coordinator has the delivery docket. Poclink handheld radios let a shore team speak over mobile networks at the press of a button. A single update can tell all three where the replacement needs to go.</p></article></div></section>";
